OL,3,GNEWSA'We all need other people' -
OL,4,Abattling loneliness
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Whenever I think of coming here I just
OL,7,Fsmile," said Sue Taylor about a social
OL,8,Fboxing group aimed at retirees in
OL,9,FGuernsey.
OL,11,FThe 73-year old former GP said being
OL,12,Fsurrounded by other retirees laughing
OL,13,Faway in their boxing gloves was the
OL,14,Fkind of group activity that "can be
OL,15,Flife saving" for those tackling
OL,16,Floneliness.
OL,18,F"We all need other people and whether
OL,19,Fit's friends, family, places like this
OL,20,Fto come, I think the more you talk
OL,21,Fabout it the better," she added.
