OL,3,GNEWSA'We all need other people' -
OL,4,Abattling loneliness
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Guernsey and Alderney Wellbeing
OL,7,FSurvey 2023, which was completed by
OL,8,Fmore than 2,300 islanders, found 32.7%
OL,9,Fof those respondents aged 65-74 felt
OL,10,F"intense social loneliness".
